I brought a few brands.

351
00:20:31,666 --> 00:20:34,305
Of these,
Sul*soo is definitely one of the best.

352
00:20:34,305 --> 00:20:38,792
I've been selling this brand for two years.

353
00:20:38,792 --> 00:20:39,845
Okay, right.

354
00:20:39,845 --> 00:20:42,311
