378
00:21:55,529 --> 00:21:58,373
We've been the undisputed No. 1 in total sales.

379
00:21:58,373 --> 00:22:00,967
We won't be disappointed. I'm sure of it.

380
00:22:00,967 --> 00:22:02,565
We've done everything we can.

381
00:22:02,565 --> 00:22:04,819
I think we can win.

382
00:22:04,819 --> 00:22:07,443
[They even visit K-beauty brands in person]

383
