402
00:23:41,120 --> 00:23:43,786
This is interesting.

403
00:23:44,800 --> 00:23:49,253
[His detailed demo gets an explosive response]

404
00:23:49,253 --> 00:23:52,393
And everyone, it's not just sheet masks.

405
00:23:52,393 --> 00:23:55,293
It even comes with an essence.

406
00:23:55,293 --> 00:23:58,524
[Ibnu smoothly leads into the next product]

407
00:23:58,524 --> 00:24:01,075
My sales from this livestream are...

408
00:24:01,075 --> 00:24:06,440
[About KRW 2.6 billion]
currently at 2 million dollars.

409
00:24:06,440 --> 00:24:09,151
Since this is
the first-ever live commerce competition,

410
00:24:09,151 --> 00:24:13,038
I want to make sure Indonesia wins.

411
00:24:13,038 --> 00:24:17,964
Our goal is to win the league.

412
00:24:18,880 --> 00:24:22,479
[The livestreams don't stop until they win]

413
00:24:23,389 --> 00:24:26,432
[Starting with an all-out K-beauty push]

414
00:24:27,849 --> 00:24:31,512
