it won't be easy for the other teams.

431
00:25:20,747 --> 00:25:23,700
[Team China was confident
when the mission was announced]

432
00:25:23,700 --> 00:25:28,190
[Team China has focused heavily on K-beauty]

433
00:25:28,190 --> 00:25:33,843
Our team's main category has been skincare.

434
00:25:33,843 --> 00:25:37,714
But for this round,

435
00:25:37,714 --> 00:25:39,805
I think we need to diversify our lineup.

436
00:25:39,805 --> 00:25:44,776
[Expanding beyond skincare
into more K-beauty categories]

437
00:25:44,776 --> 00:25:48,670
Most of our fans are women
in their 40s and 50s.

438
00:25:48,670 --> 00:25:51,676
A lot are moms who want to wear makeup
but don't really know how.

439
00:25:51,676 --> 00:25:55,347
[Team China plans makeup content
tailored to its audience]

440
00:25:55,347 --> 00:25:56,958
Then I have an idea.

441
00:25:56,958 --> 00:26:00,812
Team Korea has a makeup artist, right?

442
00:26:00,812 --> 00:26:02,696
- Sangeununnie?
- Oh, Sangeununnie.

443
00:26:02,696 --> 00:26:07,865
I thought we could learn
makeup techniques from her directly.

444
00:26:07,865 --> 00:26:11,173
[Learning makeup know-how from Sangeununnie]
Then for Round 5...

445
00:26:11,173 --> 00:26:13,031
