to wholesale it to my shop.

448
00:26:20,674 --> 00:26:21,879
[Focused]

449
00:26:21,879 --> 00:26:23,991
Yeah, I liked it enough to make that request.

450
00:26:23,991 --> 00:26:26,159
[Should we sell this one?]
The texture itself...

451
00:26:26,159 --> 00:26:29,850
It doesn't pill under makeup,
so it's really easy to use.

452
00:26:29,850 --> 00:26:33,037
[Starting the makeup routine
