455
00:26:39,376 --> 00:26:40,711
So they don't move?

456
00:26:41,806 --> 00:26:43,900
Oh, because of the lips.

457
00:26:43,900 --> 00:26:46,253
[Tip: toner pads on lips too]
To hydrate them.

458
00:26:47,093 --> 00:26:49,381
[Another Sangeununnie pro tip]
The lips too?

459
00:26:49,381 --> 00:26:52,459
Oh my gosh.
My face is basically a reflector now.

460
00:26:52,459 --> 00:26:57,165
It gives the skin a nice grip,
so everything adheres better.

461
00:26:57,165 --> 00:26:59,603
[Glowing]
It's great for prepping her skin for makeup.

462
00:26:59,603 --> 00:27:02,096
This actually belongs to someone else...

463
00:27:02,096 --> 00:27:04,583
It's our rival's product, but now I want it.

464
00:27:04,583 --> 00:27:07,203
[Very happy with her pick]
You chose well.

465
00:27:07,203 --> 00:27:11,701
Sun serums in Korea
are really lightweight these days.

466
00:27:11,701 --> 00:27:14,550
[A clear breakdown of the texture]
See how runny it is?

467
00:27:14,550 --> 00:27:17,190
With sunscreen this lightweight,
your makeup won't pill up.

468
00:27:17,190 --> 00:27:18,765
You use a brush for sun serum too?

469
00:27:18,765 --> 00:27:20,211
With a brush?

470
00:27:20,211 --> 00:27:24,016
[Her tip: apply sun serum neatly with a brush]
At the salon, we often use brushes.

471
00:27:24,016 --> 00:27:28,228
[A makeup lesson packed with pro tips]
For staying power, I use liquid concealer.

472
00:27:28,228 --> 00:27:29,879
Do you use the textured side first?

473
00:27:29,879 --> 00:27:32,750
- Yes.
- Then finish with the smooth side?

474
00:27:32,750 --> 00:27:36,748
[Picking up makeup tips for live commerce]
Yes, then one more pass with the textured side.

475
00:27:36,748 --> 00:27:39,973
Her know-how and expertise
really helped our team

476
00:27:39,973 --> 00:27:43,185
